function inlineSearch(q,box,c){q=String(q||'').trim();if(!q){box.innerHTML='';return}const run=()=>{if(box.__q!==q)return;window.__lastQ=q;const r=runSearch(q,c);box.innerHTML=lessonIcons(searchHTML(r,c));{const rb=box.querySelector('#sq-req');if(rb)rb.onclick=()=>{SFX.tap();saveReq(rb.dataset.q)}}box.querySelectorAll('.sr-go').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{SFX.tap();const s=b.dataset.s,cc=+b.dataset.c;if(s==='courses'){openExtra(+b.dataset.i);return}LP.cls=s==='current'?LP.cls:cc;saveL();active=true;lastLang=S.lang;V={v:'topic',s,c:cc,ti:+b.dataset.i};try{history.pushState({svLearn:V},'',location.href)}catch(e){}render(V)})};box.__q=q;if(SUBS.every(s=>D[s])&&D.bank)run();else{box.innerHTML='<div class="lr-card">'+word('వెతుకుతోంది…','Searching…')+'</div>';Promise.all(SUBS.concat(['bank']).map(s=>load(s).catch(()=>0))).then(()=>{SIDX=null;run()})}}
